From 68dda9a2f64777e18504a5af3b30d8e105059ef3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 21:49:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH v3 3/4] gas: testsuite: exclude microblazeel from the diff1
 and end tests

gas/all/gas.exp excludes MicroBlaze from two tests, and both guards spell the
target "microblaze-*-*".  That matches the big-endian triplet but not the
little-endian "microblazeel-*-*", so both tests run on microblazeel and fail
there while the assembler is behaving exactly as intended.

  - "difference of two undefined symbols" (diff1.s) is skipped for targets
    that resolve such differences at link time via relaxation, MicroBlaze
    among them; the comment above the list says so.

  - "all end" (end.s) is skipped where .end means something else.  MicroBlaze
    maps it to a function end point -- md_pseudo_table in tc-microblaze.c has
    {"end", microblaze_s_func, 1} -- so assembly does not stop there, and the
    deliberate garbage the test places after .end gets diagnosed, which is
    the one thing end.l asserts must not happen.

Widen both globs to "microblaze*-*-*" to cover either endianness, the shape
the avr, rl78 and rx entries in the same file already use.

With this the gas testsuite has no unexpected failures on either byte order.
On microblazeel-elf the two tests are excluded rather than fixed, so the
count goes from 328 passes and 2 unexpected failures to 328 and 0.
microblaze-elf is unaffected at 329 and 0, since microblaze*-*-* still
matches it.

gas/
	* testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp: Exclude microblaze*-*-* rather than
	microblaze-*-* from the diff1 and end tests.

Signed-off-by: Sam Price <thesamprice@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
---
 gas/testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gas/testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp b/gas/testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp
index 46451fb5a90..8ae48b2aeb6 100644
--- a/gas/testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp
+++ b/gas/testsuite/gas/all/gas.exp
@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@ if {    ![istarget alpha*-*-*vms*]
      && ![istarget avr-*-*]
      && ![istarget ft32-*-*]
      && ![istarget hppa*-*-*]
-     && ![istarget microblaze-*-*]
+     && ![istarget microblaze*-*-*]
      && ![istarget loongarch*-*-*]
      && ![istarget mn10300-*-*]
      && ![istarget msp430*-*-*]
@@ -472,7 +472,7 @@ switch -glob $target_triplet {
     alpha*-*-* { }
     hppa*-*-* { }
     iq2000-*-* { }
-    microblaze-*-* { }
+    microblaze*-*-* { }
     mips*-*-* { }
     score*-*-* { }
     xtensa*-*-* { }
